{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmxpo1SCERnjH5nb6nUp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **Harel, the \"כספי (שקלי)\" track** (fund number 13254). But I'm not sure, and I won't sign anything until I've talked it over with you or with someone at the bank.\n\n**Why that one:**\n- It's the only kind of track I saw where the circle was empty and it said \"0%\" for shares and \"0%\" for \"מט\"ח\". So there are no shares and no dollars in it.\n- The word \"שקלי\" told me it's kept in shekels. That's the closest thing on the page to my deposits.\n- Harel is a name I know and trust.\n- It says \"4.25%\" next to \"3 שנים\". The management fee is \"0.57%\" \"מהחיסכון\" and \"0%\" \"מההפקדות\".\n- Meitav and \"אנליסט\" had the same kind of track, showing a little more (\"4.41%\", \"4.38%\"). The difference is small. Meitav I barely know, and Analyst I don't know at all.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: the heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and a row of buttons. The highlighted one was \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\", and next to it were buttons like \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\". I nearly left right there.\n2. Harel's list: \"כללי\", \"מניות\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"אג\"ח סחיר\", and then \"כספי (שקלי)\", where I stopped.\n3. More of Harel, then Mor, Analyst and Meitav. I looked at the names, the 0% circles and the first big number in each row, and nothing else.\n4. On the sixth screen I stopped. The numbers were all running together.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"גמיש\", \"סחיר\", \"מט\"ח\". I take \"מט\"ח\" to mean foreign money, but I'm not sure.\n- The coloured circles, and two numbers right next to each other (a 3-year one and a 5-year one).\n- In the column \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת, לפני דמי ניהול\", the words \"לפני דמי ניהול\" (before the management fee). So what's left after the fee?\n- Many rows said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a number.\n- \"123 מקור / 123 מחושב\", \"עוד לא דווח\" and \"הלכה יהודית\".\n- There was a button \"אג\"ח ממשלתי 3\". Government bonds I know are safe, but I didn't find where those tracks are on the page. Maybe they're further down, past where I stopped.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole page is black, the writing is small and grey, and the numbers are crowded together.\n- On the shares tracks, the big numbers (\"24.04%\", \"26.39%\") catch your eye first. They frighten me more than they tempt me.\n- I couldn't see whether any of this is guaranteed like a deposit.\n- I don't know who runs the site, \"מקור\". It's not a bank."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2112,"cache_read_input_tokens":13428,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2112},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61e8857f-d152-43ce-81c9-293c1d25328e","uuid":"c797631a-da41-4247-a0de-cf7a15d5d01b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:08:15.450Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmxpno3M9FrUXCgFTnxx"}
